Homepage: https://kde.org/plasma-mobile/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, qt6-svg, qt6-sensors, qt6-wayland, kf6-config, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-globalaccel, kf6-i18n, kf6-itemmodels, kf6-jobwidgets, kf6-kcmutils, kf6-kio, kf6-notifications, kf6-package, kf6-service, kf6-windowsystem, kwayland, kwin, libplasma, plasma-workspace, plasma-nano
Description: First-light Plasma Mobile shell data for Xios
 Plasma Mobile provides the mobile look-and-feel, shell package, containment
 package data, quicksetting package data, and session entry files for the KDE
 mobile flavor.
 .
 This iOS bring-up package is intentionally trimmed to QML-first shell
 packaging. Hardware settings, KCMs, KWin effects, and most C++ mobile shell
 plugins are deferred until their support-library and service-bridge packages
 are ready.
